    "Reason : 1 - The proposed bin store by reason of location and lack of an adequate turning facility for waste collection and requiring reversing on highway within the site, fails to provide adequate waste arrangements contrary to Local Plan Policies EQ7 and The National Planning Policy Framework. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed cycle store by reason of location is not in a secure, convenient and accessible position, with the short-stay provision failing to be located close to the main building entrance. The proposal therefore fails to encourage sustainable travel and is contrary to Local Plan Policies EC2, London Plan Policies T5 and The National Planning Policy Framework. "
